      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "\n<div class=\"august-issue-banner\" style=\"background: #e0f2fe; border-color: #0284c7;\">\n    <div class=\"august-banner-badge\" style=\"background: #0284c7; color: #ffffff;\">❄️ December Issue • Part 2</div>\n    <div class=\"august-banner-content\">\n        <h4 style=\"color: #0369a1;\">Vol. 2026 — Master Editorial Hub (Part 2)</h4>\n        <p>Welcome to Part 2 of our A0–A1 High-Frequency Verb Architecture! Following our August Issue (Part 1), this December edition expands your active beginner vocabulary with 10 critical action anchors covering daily interactions, communication, perception, obligation, and social exchanges across all 14 official languages.</p>\n        <p style=\"margin-top:0.5rem;\">📌 Looking for Part 1? <a href=\"top-10-verbs.html\" style=\"color:#0284c7; font-weight:bold; text-decoration:underline;\">Explore Part 1 (August Issue) Hub ↗</a></p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2rem 0; padding: 1.5rem; background: #faf7f2; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid var(--ink-light, #e2e8f0);\">\n    <h3 style=\"margin-top:0; color:var(--post-palette-accent, #0284c7);\">🌐 14 Official Languages Part 2 Navigation Hub</h3>\n    <p style=\"color:var(--ink-secondary); margin-bottom:1.25rem;\">Jump directly to any of the 14 individual language articles for deep-dive A0–A1 conjugation patterns, natural collocations, false friends, and comparative notes:</p>\n    \n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 0.75rem;\">\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-2-en.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇬🇧 English Part 2 ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-2-fr.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇫🇷 French Part 2 ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-2-it.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇮🇹 Italian Part 2 ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-2-ru.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇷🇺 Russian Part 2 ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-2-el.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇬🇷 Greek Part 2 ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-2-tt.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🌐 Tatar Part 2 ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-2-ba.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🌐 Bashkir Part 2 ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-2-br.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🌐 Breton Part 2 ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-2-pt.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇵🇹 Portuguese Part 2 ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-2-es.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇪🇸 Spanish Part 2 ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-2-de.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇩🇪 German Part 2 ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-2-hy.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇦🇲 Armenian Part 2 ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-2-ka.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🇬🇪 Georgian Part 2 ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"top-10-verbs-part-2-cv.html\" style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; padding: 0.75rem 1rem; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; text-decoration: none; color: #1e293b; font-weight: 600;\">🌐 Chuvash Part 2 ↗</a>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"verb-map-container\">\n    <h3 class=\"verb-map-title\">🗺️ Part 2 Core Verb Scope (CEFR A0–A1 Focus)</h3>\n    <p style=\"margin-bottom:1rem; color:var(--ink-secondary);\">These 10 verb concepts expand your survival fluency into active conversations, listening comprehension, polite requests, and expressing daily obligations across all 14 official languages:</p>\n\n    <div class=\"verb-map-grid\">\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>1. Do / Make</strong> — Performing tasks, creating, general actions.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>2. Speak / Talk / Say / Tell</strong> — Expressing thoughts, speaking languages, conveying information.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>3. Look / Watch / See</strong> — Visual perception, noticing details, viewing content.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>4. Listen / Hear</strong> — Auditory attention, understanding spoken words.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>5. Must / Have To</strong> — Expressing necessity, rules, urgent needs.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>6. Take / Give / Get</strong> — Physical transactions, receiving, exchange.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>7. Live</strong> — Residence, accommodation, existing in a place.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>8. Wait</strong> — Time management, patience, waiting for transport.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>9. Understand</strong> — Comprehension, clarifying meaning in conversations.</div>\n        <div class=\"verb-node-card\"><strong>10. Ask / Answer & Want / Would Like</strong> — Inquiries, responses, polite ordering & desires.</div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.5rem 0;\">\n    <h3 class=\"editorial-heading\">🔍 14-Language Direct Comparative Matrix (Part 2)</h3>\n    <p style=\"color:var(--ink-secondary); margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\">Compare how each of the 10 Part 2 core concepts manifests across all 14 official languages in simple A0–A1 forms:</p>\n\n    <div style=\"overflow-x: auto;\">\n        <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.85rem; text-align: left;\">\n            <thead>\n                <tr style=\"background-color: var(--post-palette-accent, #0284c7); color: #ffffff;\">\n                    <th style=\"padding: 8px;\">Concept</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 8px;\">🇬🇧 EN</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 8px;\">🇫🇷 FR</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 8px;\">🇮🇹 IT</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 8px;\">🇪🇸 ES</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 8px;\">🇵🇹 PT</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 8px;\">🇩🇪 DE</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 8px;\">🇷🇺 RU</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 8px;\">🇬🇷 EL</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 8px;\">🌐 BR</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 8px;\">🇦🇲 HY</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 8px;\">🌐 TT</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 8px;\">🌐 BA</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 8px;\">🌐 CV</th>\n                    <th style=\"padding: 8px;\">🇬🇪 KA</th>\n                </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n                <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1;\">\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;\">1. Do / Make</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">do / make</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">faire</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">fare</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">hacer</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">fazer</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">machen</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">делать</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">κάνω</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ober</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">անել</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">эшләү</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">эшләү</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">тăвас</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">კეთება</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1; background: #f8fafc;\">\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;\">2. Speak / Talk</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">speak / talk</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">parler</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">parlare</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">hablar</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">falar</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">sprechen</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">говорить</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">μιλάω</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">komz</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">խոսել</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">сөйләү</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">һөйләү</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">калаçас</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ლაპარაკი</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1;\">\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;\">3. Look / See</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">look / see</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">regarder / voir</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">guardare / vedere</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">mirar / ver</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">olhar / ver</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">schauen / sehen</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">смотреть / видеть</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">κοιτάζω / βλέπω</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">sellet / gwelout</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">նայել / տեսնել</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">карау / күреү</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ҡарау / күреү</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">πăхма / курма</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ყურება / ნახვა</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1; background: #f8fafc;\">\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;\">4. Listen / Hear</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">listen / hear</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">écouter / entendre</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ascoltare / sentire</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">escuchar / oír</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ouvir / escutar</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">hören / zuhören</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">слушать / слышать</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ακούω</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">selaou / klevout</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">լսել</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">тыңлау / إшитү</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">тыңлау / ишетеү</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ИТЛЕСИ / илтме</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">მოსმენა / სმენა</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1;\">\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;\">5. Must / Need</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">must / have to</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">devoir / il faut</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">dovere</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">deber / tener que</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">dever / ter que</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">müssen / sollen</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">должен / надо</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">πρέπει</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">dleout</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">պետք է</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">тиеш / тиешле</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">тиеш / тейеш</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ΤИЕШ / кирлĕ</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">უნდა</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1; background: #f8fafc;\">\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;\">6. Take / Give / Get</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">take / give / get</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">prendre / donner</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">prendere / dare</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">tomar / dar</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">tomar / dar</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">nehmen / geben</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">брать / давать</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">παίρνω / δίνω</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">kemer / reiñ</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">վերցնել / տալ</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">алу / бирү</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">алыу / биреү</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ИЛМЕ / парас</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">აღება / მიცემა</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1;\">\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;\">7. Live</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">live</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">habiter / vivre</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">abitare / vivere</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">vivir</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">morar / viver</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">wohnen / leben</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">жить / проживать</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">μένω / ζω</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">anvezañ / bevañ</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ապրել</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">яшау</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">яшайҙар / йәшәү</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ПОРĂНМA</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ცხოვრება</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1; background: #f8fafc;\">\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;\">8. Wait</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">wait</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">attendre</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">aspettare</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">esperar</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">esperar</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">warten</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ждать</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">περιμένω</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">gortoz</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">սպասել</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">көтү</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">көтөү</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">КĔТМЕ</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ცდა</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1;\">\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;\">9. Understand</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">understand</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">comprendre</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">capire</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">entender / comprender</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">entender / compreender</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">verstehen</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">понимать</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">καταλαβαίνω</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">comprenas</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">հասկանալ</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">аңлау</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">аңлау</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ĂНЛАНМА</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">გაგება</td>\n                </tr>\n                <tr style=\"border-bottom: 1px solid #cbd5e1; background: #f8fafc;\">\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px; font-weight: bold;\">10. Ask / Answer / Want</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ask / answer / want</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">demander / répondre</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">chiedere / rispondere</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">preguntar / responder</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">perguntar / responder</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">fragen / antworten</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">спрашивать / отвечать</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ρωτάω / απαντάω</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">goulenn / respont</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">հարցնել / պատասխանել</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">сорау / җавап бирү</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">һорау / яуап биреү</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">ЫЙТМА / хурав парас</td>\n                    <td style=\"padding: 8px;\">კითხვა / პასუხი</td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody>\n        </table>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.5rem 0; padding: 1.5rem; background: #f1f5f9; border-radius: 12px;\">\n    <h3 class=\"editorial-heading\" style=\"margin-top:0;\">🧬 Family Groupings & Structural Insights (Part 2)</h3>\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">\n        <div style=\"background:#ffffff; padding:1.25rem; border-radius:8px; border-left: 4px solid #0284c7;\">\n            <h4 style=\"margin-top:0; color:#0369a1;\">🌳 Indo-European Family Notes</h4>\n            <p style=\"font-size:0.9rem; color:#334155;\">Notice how verbs of communication distinguish between targeted address (e.g., <em>tell someone</em>, <em>dire à quelqu'un</em>) vs. language skill (<em>speak French</em>, <em>parler français</em>). Modal expressions of obligation (\"must\") rely on auxiliaries in Germanic/Romance or impersonals like Greek <em>πρέπει</em>.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background:#ffffff; padding:1.25rem; border-radius:8px; border-left: 4px solid #10b981;\">\n            <h4 style=\"margin-top:0; color:#065f46;\">🏹 Turkic Family Nuances (Tatar, Bashkir, Chuvash)</h4>\n            <p style=\"font-size:0.9rem; color:#334155;\">In Turkic languages (Tatar, Bashkir, Chuvash), obligation (\"must\") is expressed using modal adjectives like <em>tiesh</em> (Tatar/Bashkir) or <em>kirle</em> (Chuvash) combined with verbal infinitives/nouns. Verbs of speech use converbs to link thoughts before reporting.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"background:#ffffff; padding:1.25rem; border-radius:8px; border-left: 4px solid #8b5cf6;\">\n            <h4 style=\"margin-top:0; color:#4c1d95;\">🏔️ Kartvelian Family Nuances (Georgian)</h4>\n            <p style=\"font-size:0.9rem; color:#334155;\">In Georgian (<em>ქართული</em>), obligation uses impersonal modal particle <em>unda</em> (უნდა) + subjunctive verb forms. Indirect verbs like \"understand\" (<em>გაგება</em>) reflect inversion structures where subject and object markers align dynamically.</p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.5rem 0;\">\n    <h3 class=\"editorial-heading\">🔗 Interactive Practice & Tools Integration</h3>\n    <p style=\"color:var(--ink-secondary); margin-bottom: 1rem;\">Master all 10 Part 2 verbs with interactive flashcard drills and live verb conjugation tables:</p>\n    \n    <div style=\"display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:1rem;\">\n        <a href=\"https://cosylanguages.github.io/COSYpractice/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem; background: var(--post-palette-accent, #0284c7); color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none;\">🎯 Practice Part 2 Drills on COSYpractice ↗</a>\n        <a href=\"https://cosylanguages.github.io/COSYtools/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem; background: #0d9488; color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none;\">🛠 Part 2 Verb Tables on COSYtools ↗</a>\n    </div>\n</section>\n"
    }
